#. Key:	Message_Sleepwalking_Interrupt_Text
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/Data/String/UI/ST_Message.ST_Message
#. InfoMetaData:	"DevComment" : "몽유병 상태로 직접 조작이 불가능할 때 표시되는 안내 메시지"
#. InfoMetaData:	"IsTranslatable" : "1"
#. InfoMetaData:	"MaxLen" : "0"
#. InfoMetaData:	"MaxLines" : "0"
#: /Game/Data/String/UI/ST_Message.ST_Message
msgctxt "ST_Message,Message_Sleepwalking_Interrupt_Text"
msgid "잠결에 행동하는 조이는 조작할 수 없습니다."
msgstr "Nie możesz kontrolować na wpół śpiącego Zoi."

#. Key:	Message_Sleepwalking_Target_Select_Text
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/Data/String/UI/ST_Message.ST_Message
#. InfoMetaData:	"DevComment" : "잠결 행동 상태 조이 대상 지정 불가 안내 메시지"
#. InfoMetaData:	"IsTranslatable" : "1"
#. InfoMetaData:	"MaxLen" : "0"
#. InfoMetaData:	"MaxLines" : "0"
#: /Game/Data/String/UI/ST_Message.ST_Message
msgctxt "ST_Message,Message_Sleepwalking_Target_Select_Text"
msgid "잠결에 행동하는 조이는 대상으로 지정할 수 없습니다."
msgstr "Nie możesz wybrać na cel wpół śpiącego Zoi."

#. Key:	Message_SmartoiPen_HintText_Text
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/Data/String/UI/ST_Message.ST_Message
#. InfoMetaData:	"DevComment" : "스마트오이 펜 힌트 문구"
#. InfoMetaData:	"IsTranslatable" : "1"
#. InfoMetaData:	"MaxLen" : "0"
#. InfoMetaData:	"MaxLines" : "0"
#: /Game/Data/String/UI/ST_Message.ST_Message
msgctxt "ST_Message,Message_SmartoiPen_HintText_Text"
msgid "You know this world is all fake; You are an AI, not human - and you want others to know."
msgstr "Już wiesz, że ten świat to fikcja. Jesteś SI, a nie człowiekiem – pora, by inni też to odkryli!"

#. Key:	Message_Snorkeling_AreaEnter_Text
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/Data/String/UI/ST_Message.ST_Message
#. InfoMetaData:	"DevComment" : "스노클링 중 깊은 바다 해역 진입 알림 메시지"
#. InfoMetaData:	"IsTranslatable" : "1"
#. InfoMetaData:	"MaxLen" : "0"
#. InfoMetaData:	"MaxLines" : "0"
#: /Game/Data/String/UI/ST_Message.ST_Message
msgctxt "ST_Message,Message_Snorkeling_AreaEnter_Text"
msgid "깊은 바다 해역으로 들어왔습니다!"
msgstr "Jesteś na głębokich wodach!"

