msgctxt "ST_SpeechBubble,SpeechBubble_SpeechBubbleData_1_InformationReveal_Preference_MessageTextId"
msgid "내 취향? 당연히 알려줄 수 있지!"
msgstr "Moje preferencje? Oczywiście, że mogę ci powiedzieć!"

#. Key:	SpeechBubble_SpeechBubbleData_1_InformationReveal_RomanceTarget_MessageTextId
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/Data/String/UI/ST_SpeechBubble.ST_SpeechBubble
#. InfoMetaData:	"DevComment" : "상대의 로맨틱 관심 대상 정보 공개 시 말풍선"
#. InfoMetaData:	"IsTranslatable" : "1"
#. InfoMetaData:	"MaxLen" : "0"
#. InfoMetaData:	"MaxLines" : "0"
#: /Game/Data/String/UI/ST_SpeechBubble.ST_SpeechBubble
msgctxt "ST_SpeechBubble,SpeechBubble_SpeechBubbleData_1_InformationReveal_RomanceTarget_MessageTextId"
msgid "내가 끌리는 대상이 궁금해? 당연히 알려줄 수 있지!"
msgstr "Chcesz wiedzieć, jakie osoby mi się podobają? Z przyjemnością ci powiem!"

#. Key:	SpeechBubble_SpeechBubbleData_1_InformationReveal_RomanticOrientation_False_MessageTextId
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/Data/String/UI/ST_SpeechBubble.ST_SpeechBubble
#. InfoMetaData:	"DevComment" : "연애 관심 없음 정보 공개 말풍선"
#. InfoMetaData:	"IsTranslatable" : "1"
#. InfoMetaData:	"MaxLen" : "0"
#. InfoMetaData:	"MaxLines" : "0"
#: /Game/Data/String/UI/ST_SpeechBubble.ST_SpeechBubble
msgctxt "ST_SpeechBubble,SpeechBubble_SpeechBubbleData_1_InformationReveal_RomanticOrientation_False_MessageTextId"
msgid "나는 사랑에는 크게 관심이 없어."
msgstr "Naprawdę nie interesuje mnie romans."

#. Key:	SpeechBubble_SpeechBubbleData_1_InformationReveal_RomanticOrientation_True_MessageTextId
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/Data/String/UI/ST_SpeechBubble.ST_SpeechBubble
#. InfoMetaData:	"DevComment" : "정보 공개 시 연애 관심 있음 말풍선"
#. InfoMetaData:	"IsTranslatable" : "1"
#. InfoMetaData:	"MaxLen" : "0"
#. InfoMetaData:	"MaxLines" : "0"
#: /Game/Data/String/UI/ST_SpeechBubble.ST_SpeechBubble
msgctxt "ST_SpeechBubble,SpeechBubble_SpeechBubbleData_1_InformationReveal_RomanticOrientation_True_MessageTextId"
msgid "내가 관심 있는 사람은…"
msgstr "Interesuję się…"

#. Key:	SpeechBubble_SpeechBubbleData_1_InformationReveal_Trait_Achiever_MessageTextId
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/Data/String/UI/ST_SpeechBubble.ST_SpeechBubble
#. InfoMetaData:	"DevComment" : "성향 정보 공개 시 어치버 성향 소개 말풍선 문구"
#. InfoMetaData:	"IsTranslatable" : "1"
#. InfoMetaData:	"MaxLen" : "0"
#. InfoMetaData:	"MaxLines" : "0"
#: /Game/Data/String/UI/ST_SpeechBubble.ST_SpeechBubble
msgctxt "ST_SpeechBubble,SpeechBubble_SpeechBubbleData_1_InformationReveal_Trait_Achiever_MessageTextId"
msgid "난 목표 지향적이야. 뭐든 효율적으로 하고 싶고, 항상 최고가 되려고 노력해."
msgstr "Stawiam na cele. Lubię działać skutecznie i robić wszystko możliwie najlepiej."

#. Key:	SpeechBubble_SpeechBubbleData_1_InformationReveal_Trait_Activist_MessageTextId
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/Data/String/UI/ST_SpeechBubble.ST_SpeechBubble
#. InfoMetaData:	"DevComment" : "대화 중 활동가 특성 정보 노출 말풍선"
#. InfoMetaData:	"IsTranslatable" : "1"
#. InfoMetaData:	"MaxLen" : "0"
#. InfoMetaData:	"MaxLines" : "0"
#: /Game/Data/String/UI/ST_SpeechBubble.ST_SpeechBubble
msgctxt "ST_SpeechBubble,SpeechBubble_SpeechBubbleData_1_InformationReveal_Trait_Activist_MessageTextId"
msgid "난 세상을 좀 더 나은 곳으로 만들고 싶어. 사회 문제에 관심 많고, 공정하고 성실하게 사는 게 중요하다고 생각해."
msgstr "Chcę naprawiać świat. Interesują mnie problemy społeczne i wierzę w wartość uczciwego życia."

#. Key:	SpeechBubble_SpeechBubbleData_1_InformationReveal_Trait_Adventurer_MessageTextId
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/Data/String/UI/ST_SpeechBubble.ST_SpeechBubble
#. InfoMetaData:	"DevComment" : "모험가 특성 정보 공개 말풍선 문구"
#. InfoMetaData:	"IsTranslatable" : "1"
#. InfoMetaData:	"MaxLen" : "0"
#. InfoMetaData:	"MaxLines" : "0"
#: /Game/Data/String/UI/ST_SpeechBubble.ST_SpeechBubble
msgctxt "ST_SpeechBubble,SpeechBubble_SpeechBubbleData_1_InformationReveal_Trait_Adventurer_MessageTextId"
msgid "난 도전을 좋아해. 내가 원하는 건 꼭 해내고, 새로운 걸 경험하는 데 망설임이 없어."
msgstr "Lubię wyzwania. Robię wszystko, co chcę, i nie waham się, gdy w grę wchodzą nowe doświadczenia."

#. Key:	SpeechBubble_SpeechBubbleData_1_InformationReveal_Trait_Arrogant_MessageTextId
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/Data/String/UI/ST_SpeechBubble.ST_SpeechBubble
#. InfoMetaData:	"DevComment" : "오만 특성 정보 공개 말풍선"
#. InfoMetaData:	"IsTranslatable" : "1"
#. InfoMetaData:	"MaxLen" : "0"
#. InfoMetaData:	"MaxLines" : "0"
#: /Game/Data/String/UI/ST_SpeechBubble.ST_SpeechBubble
msgctxt "ST_SpeechBubble,SpeechBubble_SpeechBubbleData_1_InformationReveal_Trait_Arrogant_MessageTextId"
msgid "난 내가 옳다고 생각하면 끝까지 밀어붙이는 편이야. 내 의견을 존중받고 싶고, 힘을 중요하게 생각해."
msgstr "Trzymam się tego, co wydaje się słuszne. Cenię władzę i chcę, aby moje opinie były szanowane."

#. Key:	SpeechBubble_SpeechBubbleData_1_InformationReveal_Trait_Artist_MessageTextId
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/Data/String/UI/ST_SpeechBubble.ST_SpeechBubble
#. InfoMetaData:	"DevComment" : "대화 중 예술가 특성 정보 공개 말풍선"
#. InfoMetaData:	"IsTranslatable" : "1"
#. InfoMetaData:	"MaxLen" : "0"
#. InfoMetaData:	"MaxLines" : "0"
#: /Game/Data/String/UI/ST_SpeechBubble.ST_SpeechBubble
msgctxt "ST_SpeechBubble,SpeechBubble_SpeechBubbleData_1_InformationReveal_Trait_Artist_MessageTextId"
msgid "나는 내 감정을 표현하는 게 중요해. 특별한 사람이 되고 싶고, 평범한 건 딱 질색이야."
msgstr "Przykładam ogromną wagę do wyrażania uczuć. Chcę być wyjątkową osobą i nienawidzę przeciętności."

#. Key:	SpeechBubble_SpeechBubbleData_1_InformationReveal_Trait_Child_MessageTextId
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/Data/String/UI/ST_SpeechBubble.ST_SpeechBubble
#. InfoMetaData:	"DevComment" : "아동 심 특성 공개 말풍선"
#. InfoMetaData:	"IsTranslatable" : "1"
#. InfoMetaData:	"MaxLen" : "0"
#. InfoMetaData:	"MaxLines" : "0"
#: /Game/Data/String/UI/ST_SpeechBubble.ST_SpeechBubble
msgctxt "ST_SpeechBubble,SpeechBubble_SpeechBubbleData_1_InformationReveal_Trait_Child_MessageTextId"
msgid "우와! 나는, 나는 말이야~"
msgstr "Wow! W takim razie opowiem ci o sobie!"

#. Key:	SpeechBubble_SpeechBubbleData_1_InformationReveal_Trait_Cooperator_MessageTextId
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/Data/String/UI/ST_SpeechBubble.ST_SpeechBubble
#. InfoMetaData:	"DevComment" : "협조적 특성 정보 공개 말풍선"
#. InfoMetaData:	"IsTranslatable" : "1"
#. InfoMetaData:	"MaxLen" : "0"
#. InfoMetaData:	"MaxLines" : "0"
#: /Game/Data/String/UI/ST_SpeechBubble.ST_SpeechBubble
msgctxt "ST_SpeechBubble,SpeechBubble_SpeechBubbleData_1_InformationReveal_Trait_Cooperator_MessageTextId"
msgid "난 딱히 정해진 방식에 얽매이는 스타일은 아냐. 필요하다면 규칙도 바꿔야 한다고 생각해."
msgstr "Nie jestem osobą, która trzyma się ustalonych metod. Uważam, że w razie potrzeby trzeba zmieniać nawet zasady"

#. Key:	SpeechBubble_SpeechBubbleData_1_InformationReveal_Trait_Dreamer_MessageTextId
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/Data/String/UI/ST_SpeechBubble.ST_SpeechBubble
#. InfoMetaData:	"DevComment" : "성향 정보 공개 시 이상주의자 성향 소개 말풍선 문구"
#. InfoMetaData:	"IsTranslatable" : "1"
#. InfoMetaData:	"MaxLen" : "0"
#. InfoMetaData:	"MaxLines" : "0"
#: /Game/Data/String/UI/ST_SpeechBubble.ST_SpeechBubble
msgctxt "ST_SpeechBubble,SpeechBubble_SpeechBubbleData_1_InformationReveal_Trait_Dreamer_MessageTextId"
msgid "현실은 답답하지만, 언젠가는 더 나은 세상이 올 거라 믿어. 지금은 내 속도로 조용히 꿈을 키우는 중이야."
msgstr "Ten świat jest frustrujący, ale wierzę, że może być lepszy. Na razie spokojnie realizuję marzenia we własnym tempie"

#. Key:	SpeechBubble_SpeechBubbleData_1_InformationReveal_Trait_Entertainer_MessageTextId
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/Data/String/UI/ST_SpeechBubble.ST_SpeechBubble
#. InfoMetaData:	"DevComment" : "정보 공개 말풍선용 엔터테이너 특성 자기소개 문구"
#. InfoMetaData:	"IsTranslatable" : "1"
#. InfoMetaData:	"MaxLen" : "0"
#. InfoMetaData:	"MaxLines" : "0"
#: /Game/Data/String/UI/ST_SpeechBubble.ST_SpeechBubble
msgctxt "ST_SpeechBubble,SpeechBubble_SpeechBubbleData_1_InformationReveal_Trait_Entertainer_MessageTextId"
msgid "나는 에너지가 넘치고, 사람들이랑 웃고 떠드는 게 좋아. 재미있는 일을 찾아다니는 게 내 스타일이야."
msgstr "Mam masę energii i kocham rozmawiać z ludźmi. W życiu stawiam na poszukiwanie rozrywki."

#. Key:	SpeechBubble_SpeechBubbleData_1_InformationReveal_Trait_Helper_MessageTextId
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/Data/String/UI/ST_SpeechBubble.ST_SpeechBubble
#. InfoMetaData:	"DevComment" : "성향 정보 공개 시 헬퍼 성향 소개 말풍선 문구"
#. InfoMetaData:	"IsTranslatable" : "1"
#. InfoMetaData:	"MaxLen" : "0"
#. InfoMetaData:	"MaxLines" : "0"
#: /Game/Data/String/UI/ST_SpeechBubble.ST_SpeechBubble
msgctxt "ST_SpeechBubble,SpeechBubble_SpeechBubbleData_1_InformationReveal_Trait_Helper_MessageTextId"
msgid "사람 많은 곳은 피곤해. 조용한 공간에서 나만의 시간을 보내는 게 훨씬 편하고 좋아."
msgstr "Tłumy mnie męczą. Wolę spędzać czas w samotności w jakimś spokojnym miejscu."

#. Key:	SpeechBubble_SpeechBubbleData_1_InformationReveal_Trait_Independent_MessageTextId
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/Data/String/UI/ST_SpeechBubble.ST_SpeechBubble
#. InfoMetaData:	"DevComment" : "독립적 특성 정보 노출 말풍선"
#. InfoMetaData:	"IsTranslatable" : "1"
#. InfoMetaData:	"MaxLen" : "0"
#. InfoMetaData:	"MaxLines" : "0"
#: /Game/Data/String/UI/ST_SpeechBubble.ST_SpeechBubble
msgctxt "ST_SpeechBubble,SpeechBubble_SpeechBubbleData_1_InformationReveal_Trait_Independent_MessageTextId"
msgid "난 혼자 있는 게 좋아. 내 생각에 몰두하는 게 편하고, 남들이 뭐라 하든 별로 신경 안 써."
msgstr "Lubię samotność. Dobrze się czuję we własnej głowie i nie obchodzi mnie, co inni mają do powiedzenia."

#. Key:	SpeechBubble_SpeechBubbleData_1_InformationReveal_Trait_Intellect_MessageTextId
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/Data/String/UI/ST_SpeechBubble.ST_SpeechBubble
#. InfoMetaData:	"DevComment" : "지성 특성 공개 시 말풍선 대사"
#. InfoMetaData:	"IsTranslatable" : "1"
#. InfoMetaData:	"MaxLen" : "0"
#. InfoMetaData:	"MaxLines" : "0"
#: /Game/Data/String/UI/ST_SpeechBubble.ST_SpeechBubble
msgctxt "ST_SpeechBubble,SpeechBubble_SpeechBubbleData_1_InformationReveal_Trait_Intellect_MessageTextId"
msgid "나는 깊이 있는 걸 좋아해. 겉핥기는 싫고, 하나를 알아도 제대로 알고 싶어."
msgstr "Lubię głębię. Nie interesują mnie płytkie opinie. Chcę naprawdę zrozumieć to, czego się uczę"

#. Key:	SpeechBubble_SpeechBubbleData_1_InformationReveal_Trait_Leader_MessageTextId
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/Data/String/UI/ST_SpeechBubble.ST_SpeechBubble
#. InfoMetaData:	"DevComment" : "성향 정보 공개 시 리더 성향 소개 말풍선 문구"
#. InfoMetaData:	"IsTranslatable" : "1"
#. InfoMetaData:	"MaxLen" : "0"
#. InfoMetaData:	"MaxLines" : "0"
#: /Game/Data/String/UI/ST_SpeechBubble.ST_SpeechBubble
msgctxt "ST_SpeechBubble,SpeechBubble_SpeechBubbleData_1_InformationReveal_Trait_Leader_MessageTextId"
msgid "난 사람들을 지키고 이끄는 게 좋아. 주변 사람들한테 신뢰받는 리더가 되고 싶어."
msgstr "Lubię przewodzić i dbać o innych. Chcę być kimś, kto jest uznawany za lidera godnego zaufania."

#. Key:	SpeechBubble_SpeechBubbleData_1_InformationReveal_Trait_Observer_MessageTextId
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/Data/String/UI/ST_SpeechBubble.ST_SpeechBubble
#. InfoMetaData:	"DevComment" : "관찰자 특성 정보 노출 말풍선 문구"
#. InfoMetaData:	"IsTranslatable" : "1"
#. InfoMetaData:	"MaxLen" : "0"
#. InfoMetaData:	"MaxLines" : "0"
#: /Game/Data/String/UI/ST_SpeechBubble.ST_SpeechBubble
msgctxt "ST_SpeechBubble,SpeechBubble_SpeechBubbleData_1_InformationReveal_Trait_Observer_MessageTextId"
msgid "난 궁금한 게 많아서 항상 배우고 연구하는 걸 좋아해. 새로운 지식이나 상상 속에서 답을 찾으려고 해."
msgstr "Lubię się uczyć i badać zagadnienia, aby zaspokoić ciekawość. Stawiam na informacje i wyobraźnię podczas poszukiwania odpowiedzi."

#. Key:	SpeechBubble_SpeechBubbleData_1_InformationReveal_Trait_Peacemaker_MessageTextId
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/Data/String/UI/ST_SpeechBubble.ST_SpeechBubble
#. InfoMetaData:	"DevComment" : "성향 정보 공개 시 평화주의자 성향 소개 말풍선 문구"
#. InfoMetaData:	"IsTranslatable" : "1"
#. InfoMetaData:	"MaxLen" : "0"
#. InfoMetaData:	"MaxLines" : "0"
#: /Game/Data/String/UI/ST_SpeechBubble.ST_SpeechBubble
msgctxt "ST_SpeechBubble,SpeechBubble_SpeechBubbleData_1_InformationReveal_Trait_Peacemaker_MessageTextId"
msgid "난 평화로운 게 좋아. 갈등을 줄이고 모두가 잘 지낼 수 있게 도와주는 게 내 방식이야."
msgstr "Lubię, gdy jest spokojnie. Ograniczanie konfliktów i sprawianie, żeby wszyscy się dogadywali, to mój sposób na życie."

#. Key:	SpeechBubble_SpeechBubbleData_1_InformationReveal_Trait_Perfectionist_MessageTextId
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/Data/String/UI/ST_SpeechBubble.ST_SpeechBubble
#. InfoMetaData:	"DevComment" : "성향 정보 공개 시 완벽주의자 성향 소개 말풍선 문구"
#. InfoMetaData:	"IsTranslatable" : "1"
#. InfoMetaData:	"MaxLen" : "0"
#. InfoMetaData:	"MaxLines" : "0"
#: /Game/Data/String/UI/ST_SpeechBubble.ST_SpeechBubble
msgctxt "ST_SpeechBubble,SpeechBubble_SpeechBubbleData_1_InformationReveal_Trait_Perfectionist_MessageTextId"
msgid "나는 뭐든지 완벽하게 하려고 노력해. 계획도 철저히 세우고 감정보다는 이성적으로 판단하려고 하지."
msgstr "Staram się osiągnąć perfekcję. Planuję wszystko starannie i podejmuję decyzje oparte na rozsądku, a nie na emocjach."

#. Key:	SpeechBubble_SpeechBubbleData_1_InformationReveal_Trait_Popular_MessageTextId
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/Data/String/UI/ST_SpeechBubble.ST_SpeechBubble
#. InfoMetaData:	"DevComment" : "성향 정보 공개 시 인기추구 성향 소개 말풍선 문구"
#. InfoMetaData:	"IsTranslatable" : "1"
#. InfoMetaData:	"MaxLen" : "0"
#. InfoMetaData:	"MaxLines" : "0"
#: /Game/Data/String/UI/ST_SpeechBubble.ST_SpeechBubble
msgctxt "ST_SpeechBubble,SpeechBubble_SpeechBubbleData_1_InformationReveal_Trait_Popular_MessageTextId"
msgid "난 사람들한테 좋은 인상을 남기는 게 중요해. 항상 성공을 목표로 하고, 주목받는 걸 좋아해."
msgstr "Chcę na wszystkich wywierać dobre wrażenie. Zależy mi na sukcesie i byciu w świetle reflektorów."

#. Key:	SpeechBubble_SpeechBubbleData_1_InformationReveal_Trait_Risk-averse_MessageTextId
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/Data/String/UI/ST_SpeechBubble.ST_SpeechBubble
#. InfoMetaData:	"DevComment" : "위험회피 성향 정보 공개 말풍선 메시지"
#. InfoMetaData:	"IsTranslatable" : "1"
#. InfoMetaData:	"MaxLen" : "0"
#. InfoMetaData:	"MaxLines" : "0"
#: /Game/Data/String/UI/ST_SpeechBubble.ST_SpeechBubble
msgctxt "ST_SpeechBubble,SpeechBubble_SpeechBubbleData_1_InformationReveal_Trait_Risk-averse_MessageTextId"
msgid "나는 안정감을 중요하게 생각해. 항상 대비하고, 믿을 수 있는 사람들이랑 함께 있는 게 좋아."
msgstr "Cenię przede wszystkim stabilność. Zostaję z ludźmi, którym ufam, i zawsze na wszystko się przygotowuję."

#. Key:	SpeechBubble_SpeechBubbleData_1_InformationReveal_Trait_Romantic_MessageTextId
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/Data/String/UI/ST_SpeechBubble.ST_SpeechBubble
#. InfoMetaData:	"DevComment" : "성향 정보 공개 시 로맨틱 성향 소개 말풍선 문구"
#. InfoMetaData:	"IsTranslatable" : "1"
#. InfoMetaData:	"MaxLen" : "0"
#. InfoMetaData:	"MaxLines" : "0"
#: /Game/Data/String/UI/ST_SpeechBubble.ST_SpeechBubble
msgctxt "ST_SpeechBubble,SpeechBubble_SpeechBubbleData_1_InformationReveal_Trait_Romantic_MessageTextId"
msgid "난 애정을 주고받는 걸 좋아해. 사람들과 쉽게 친해지고, 나만의 매력으로 사람들 기분 좋게 만드는 게 즐거워."
msgstr "Lubię okazywać innym uczucia. Łatwo zdobywam przyjaciół i oczarowuję innych, aby zawsze się dobrze bawili."

#. Key:	SpeechBubble_SpeechBubbleData_1_Interaction_Fishing_Broken_MessageTextId
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/Data/String/UI/ST_SpeechBubble.ST_SpeechBubble
#. InfoMetaData:	"DevComment" : "낚시 도중 낚싯대 파손 시 노출되는 상호작용 말풍선"
#. InfoMetaData:	"IsTranslatable" : "1"
#. InfoMetaData:	"MaxLen" : "0"
#. InfoMetaData:	"MaxLines" : "0"
#: /Game/Data/String/UI/ST_SpeechBubble.ST_SpeechBubble
msgctxt "ST_SpeechBubble,SpeechBubble_SpeechBubbleData_1_Interaction_Fishing_Broken_MessageTextId"
msgid "낚싯대가 부러졌다!"
msgstr "Wędka się złamała!"

#. Key:	SpeechBubble_SpeechBubbleData_1_Interaction_FishingResult_Fail_MessageTextId
