#. Key:	SpeechBubble_SpeechBubbleData_1_SpeechBubble_AR_Librarian_01_MessageTextId
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/Data/String/UI/ST_SpeechBubble.ST_SpeechBubble
#. InfoMetaData:	"DevComment" : "좋은 책 추천해 달라고 하기_AR 사서"
#. InfoMetaData:	"IsTranslatable" : "1"
#. InfoMetaData:	"MaxLen" : "0"
#. InfoMetaData:	"MaxLines" : "0"
#: /Game/Data/String/UI/ST_SpeechBubble.ST_SpeechBubble
msgctxt "ST_SpeechBubble,SpeechBubble_SpeechBubbleData_1_SpeechBubble_AR_Librarian_01_MessageTextId"
msgid "자기개발서를 읽어보는 건 어때요? 누군가 먼저 겪어본 어려움을 따라가다 보면, 마음이 조금은 가벼워질 거예요."
msgstr "Może warto przeczytać jakiś poradnik? Podążanie ścieżką osoby, która już zmierzyła się z podobnymi problemami, może nieco rozjaśnić twoje serce."

#. Key:	SpeechBubble_SpeechBubbleData_1_SpeechBubble_AR_Librarian_02_MessageTextId
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/Data/String/UI/ST_SpeechBubble.ST_SpeechBubble
#. InfoMetaData:	"DevComment" : "가장 좋아하는 책에 대해 묻기_AR 사서"
#. InfoMetaData:	"IsTranslatable" : "1"
#. InfoMetaData:	"MaxLen" : "0"
#. InfoMetaData:	"MaxLines" : "0"
#: /Game/Data/String/UI/ST_SpeechBubble.ST_SpeechBubble
msgctxt "ST_SpeechBubble,SpeechBubble_SpeechBubbleData_1_SpeechBubble_AR_Librarian_02_MessageTextId"
msgid "누군가의 삶을 기록한 책을 좋아해요. 화려하진 않아도, 시간의 흔적들이 그대로 남아 있거든요."
msgstr "Cenię sobie książki, które opowiadają o czyimś życiu. Mogą nie być efektowne, ale niosą ze sobą autentyczne ślady czasu."

#. Key:	SpeechBubble_SpeechBubbleData_1_SpeechBubble_AR_Librarian_03_MessageTextId
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/Data/String/UI/ST_SpeechBubble.ST_SpeechBubble
#. InfoMetaData:	"DevComment" : "도서관의 역사에 대해 묻기_AR 사서"
#. InfoMetaData:	"IsTranslatable" : "1"
#. InfoMetaData:	"MaxLen" : "0"
#. InfoMetaData:	"MaxLines" : "0"
#: /Game/Data/String/UI/ST_SpeechBubble.ST_SpeechBubble
msgctxt "ST_SpeechBubble,SpeechBubble_SpeechBubbleData_1_SpeechBubble_AR_Librarian_03_MessageTextId"
msgid "이 도서관은 처음부터 이렇게 크지 않았어요. 한 사람의 기록을 보관하기 위해 만들어진 작은 공간이었죠."
msgstr "Ta biblioteka nie zawsze była tak rozległa. Początkowo była to niewielka przestrzeń stworzona do przechowywania dokumentów jednej osoby."

#. Key:	SpeechBubble_SpeechBubbleData_1_SpeechBubble_AR_Librarian_04_MessageTextId
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/Data/String/UI/ST_SpeechBubble.ST_SpeechBubble
#. InfoMetaData:	"DevComment" : "도서관의 숨겨진 비밀 묻기_AR 사서"
#. InfoMetaData:	"IsTranslatable" : "1"
#. InfoMetaData:	"MaxLen" : "0"
#. InfoMetaData:	"MaxLines" : "0"
#: /Game/Data/String/UI/ST_SpeechBubble.ST_SpeechBubble
msgctxt "ST_SpeechBubble,SpeechBubble_SpeechBubbleData_1_SpeechBubble_AR_Librarian_04_MessageTextId"
msgid "알고 계셨나요? 이 도서관에는 책만 보관된 게 아니랍니다."
msgstr "Czy wiesz? Ta biblioteka nie przechowuje tylko książek."

#. Key:	SpeechBubble_SpeechBubbleData_1_SpeechBubble_AR_Librarian_05_MessageTextId
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/Data/String/UI/ST_SpeechBubble.ST_SpeechBubble
#. InfoMetaData:	"DevComment" : "2층은 언제 열리는지 묻기_AR 사서"
#. InfoMetaData:	"IsTranslatable" : "1"
#. InfoMetaData:	"MaxLen" : "0"
#. InfoMetaData:	"MaxLines" : "0"
#: /Game/Data/String/UI/ST_SpeechBubble.ST_SpeechBubble
msgctxt "ST_SpeechBubble,SpeechBubble_SpeechBubbleData_1_SpeechBubble_AR_Librarian_05_MessageTextId"
msgid "글쎄요. 내일이 될 수도 있고, 꽤 시간이 흐른 뒤가 될 수도 있겠죠. 그 시점은 누구도 단정할 수 없습니다."
msgstr "Może to nastąpić jutro, a może dopiero za jakiś czas. Nikt nie jest w stanie z całą pewnością stwierdzić, kiedy to będzie."

#. Key:	SpeechBubble_SpeechBubbleData_1_SpeechBubble_AR_Librarian_06_MessageTextId
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/Data/String/UI/ST_SpeechBubble.ST_SpeechBubble
#. InfoMetaData:	"DevComment" : "삶의 의미에 대해 묻기_AR 사서"
#. InfoMetaData:	"IsTranslatable" : "1"
#. InfoMetaData:	"MaxLen" : "0"
#. InfoMetaData:	"MaxLines" : "0"
#: /Game/Data/String/UI/ST_SpeechBubble.ST_SpeechBubble
msgctxt "ST_SpeechBubble,SpeechBubble_SpeechBubbleData_1_SpeechBubble_AR_Librarian_06_MessageTextId"
msgid "저는 삶이란 늘 한 장으로 정리되지 않는다고 생각해요. 여러 장 사이에 흩어져 있지만, 그 장들을 넘기다 보면 어느 순간 방향이 생기죠."
msgstr "Uważam, że życie nie zawsze można streścić na jednej stronie. Rozciąga się ono na wiele stron, ale gdy je przekręcasz, w pewnym momencie zaczyna się ukazywać pewien kierunek."

#. Key:	SpeechBubble_SpeechBubbleData_1_SpeechBubble_AR_Librarian_GhostQuest_Find_MessageTextId
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/Data/String/UI/ST_SpeechBubble.ST_SpeechBubble
#. InfoMetaData:	"DevComment" : "AR 도서관 사서 클레어의 유령 퀘스트 발견 안내 말풍선"
#. InfoMetaData:	"IsTranslatable" : "1"
#. InfoMetaData:	"MaxLen" : "0"
#. InfoMetaData:	"MaxLines" : "0"
#: /Game/Data/String/UI/ST_SpeechBubble.ST_SpeechBubble
msgctxt "ST_SpeechBubble,SpeechBubble_SpeechBubbleData_1_SpeechBubble_AR_Librarian_GhostQuest_Find_MessageTextId"
msgid "난 AR 도서관의 사서, 클레어라고 해요. 당신은 방금 죽어서 유령이 되었군요."
msgstr "Jestem Claire, bibliotekarka w bibliotece AR. Nie żyjesz i jesteś duchem"

#. Key:	SpeechBubble_SpeechBubbleData_1_SpeechBubble_AR_Librarian_GhostQuest_Hope_MessageTextId
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/Data/String/UI/ST_SpeechBubble.ST_SpeechBubble
#. InfoMetaData:	"DevComment" : "사서 AR 유령 퀘스트 기대 획득 상태 말풍선 대사"
#. InfoMetaData:	"IsTranslatable" : "1"
#. InfoMetaData:	"MaxLen" : "0"
#. InfoMetaData:	"MaxLines" : "0"
#: /Game/Data/String/UI/ST_SpeechBubble.ST_SpeechBubble
msgctxt "ST_SpeechBubble,SpeechBubble_SpeechBubbleData_1_SpeechBubble_AR_Librarian_GhostQuest_Hope_MessageTextId"
msgid "지금 막 ‘기대’를 얻었을 거예요. 그 기대를 수행하면 특별한 능력을 얻게 될 거랍니다."
msgstr "Właśnie odczuwasz pragnienie. Zrealizuj je, aby odblokować specjalną umiejętność"

#. Key:	SpeechBubble_SpeechBubbleData_1_SpeechBubble_AR_Librarian_GhostQuest_Normal_MessageTextId
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/Data/String/UI/ST_SpeechBubble.ST_SpeechBubble
#. InfoMetaData:	"DevComment" : "사서 AR 유령 퀘스트 일반 상태 말풍선 대사"
#. InfoMetaData:	"IsTranslatable" : "1"
#. InfoMetaData:	"MaxLen" : "0"
#. InfoMetaData:	"MaxLines" : "0"
#: /Game/Data/String/UI/ST_SpeechBubble.ST_SpeechBubble
msgctxt "ST_SpeechBubble,SpeechBubble_SpeechBubbleData_1_SpeechBubble_AR_Librarian_GhostQuest_Normal_MessageTextId"
msgid "저는 유령을 볼 수 있어요. 그들과 대화하면 '영력'을 얻고, 그 영력으로 특별한 능력을 쓸 수 있습니다."
msgstr "Widzę duchy. Rozmowa z duchami daje energię duchową, którą można wykorzystać przy specjalnej umiejętności"

#. Key:	SpeechBubble_SpeechBubbleData_1_SpeechBubble_Ask_BlockPhoneNumber_Cancel_Fail_MessageTextId
