#. InfoMetaData:	"DevComment" : "유령 퀘스트 02 반지 조사 반응 말풍선"
#. InfoMetaData:	"IsTranslatable" : "1"
#. InfoMetaData:	"MaxLen" : "0"
#. InfoMetaData:	"MaxLines" : "0"
#: /Game/Data/String/UI/ST_SpeechBubble.ST_SpeechBubble
msgctxt "ST_SpeechBubble,SpeechBubble_SpeechBubbleData_1_SpeechBubble_Ghost_Quest_02_2_MessageTextId"
msgid "이 반지… 아직 따뜻하네. 마치 두 유령이 지금도 손을 잡고 있는 것 같아."
msgstr "Ta obrączka… Nadal jest ciepła, jakby duchy wciąż trzymały się za ręce"

#. Key:	SpeechBubble_SpeechBubbleData_1_SpeechBubble_Ghost_Quest_02_3_MessageTextId
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/Data/String/UI/ST_SpeechBubble.ST_SpeechBubble
#. InfoMetaData:	"DevComment" : "유령 퀘스트 02 반지 반환 감사 말풍선"
#. InfoMetaData:	"IsTranslatable" : "1"
#. InfoMetaData:	"MaxLen" : "0"
#. InfoMetaData:	"MaxLines" : "0"
#: /Game/Data/String/UI/ST_SpeechBubble.ST_SpeechBubble
msgctxt "ST_SpeechBubble,SpeechBubble_SpeechBubbleData_1_SpeechBubble_Ghost_Quest_02_3_MessageTextId"
msgid "정말 고맙습니다… 다시 이 반지를 손에 쥐게 될 줄은 몰랐어요. 당신 덕분에, 우리의 약속이 잊히지 않았네요."
msgstr "Bardzo dziękuję… Znowu mogę trzymać tę obrączkę. Dzięki tobie nasza obietnica nie umarła"

#. Key:	SpeechBubble_SpeechBubbleData_1_SpeechBubble_Ghost_Quest_02_4_MessageTextId
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/Data/String/UI/ST_SpeechBubble.ST_SpeechBubble
#. InfoMetaData:	"DevComment" : "유령 퀘스트 02 완료 감사 말풍선"
#. InfoMetaData:	"IsTranslatable" : "1"
#. InfoMetaData:	"MaxLen" : "0"
#. InfoMetaData:	"MaxLines" : "0"
#: /Game/Data/String/UI/ST_SpeechBubble.ST_SpeechBubble
msgctxt "ST_SpeechBubble,SpeechBubble_SpeechBubbleData_1_SpeechBubble_Ghost_Quest_02_4_MessageTextId"
msgid "정말 찾아주셨군요… 그분들도 이제 마음 편히 함께할 수 있겠어요. 감사합니다"
msgstr "Udało ci się… Teraz wreszcie mogą razem spoczywać w pokoju. Dziękuję"

#. Key:	SpeechBubble_SpeechBubbleData_1_SpeechBubble_Ghost_Quest_02_Start_MessageTextId
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/Data/String/UI/ST_SpeechBubble.ST_SpeechBubble
#. InfoMetaData:	"DevComment" : "유령 퀘스트 02 시작 안내 말풍선"
#. InfoMetaData:	"IsTranslatable" : "1"
#. InfoMetaData:	"MaxLen" : "0"
#. InfoMetaData:	"MaxLines" : "0"
#: /Game/Data/String/UI/ST_SpeechBubble.ST_SpeechBubble
msgctxt "ST_SpeechBubble,SpeechBubble_SpeechBubbleData_1_SpeechBubble_Ghost_Quest_02_Start_MessageTextId"
msgid "잃어버린 반지를 찾아 헤매는 슬픈 유령이 있다고 합니다… 그에게 담긴 이야기를, 들어주시겠어요?"
msgstr "Podobno jakiś smutny duch poszukuje zgubionej obrączki… Wysłuchasz tej opowieści i dowiesz się, co się stało?"

#. Key:	SpeechBubble_SpeechBubbleData_1_SpeechBubble_Ghost_Quest_03_1_MessageTextId
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/Data/String/UI/ST_SpeechBubble.ST_SpeechBubble
#. InfoMetaData:	"DevComment" : "유령 퀘스트 03 진행 중 편지 전달을 부탁하는 말풍선"
#. InfoMetaData:	"IsTranslatable" : "1"
#. InfoMetaData:	"MaxLen" : "0"
#. InfoMetaData:	"MaxLines" : "0"
#: /Game/Data/String/UI/ST_SpeechBubble.ST_SpeechBubble
msgctxt "ST_SpeechBubble,SpeechBubble_SpeechBubbleData_1_SpeechBubble_Ghost_Quest_03_1_MessageTextId"
msgid "그날… 불길 속에서 끝내 전하지 못한 편지가 있습니다. 대신, 전해주실 수 있을까요?"
msgstr "Jest pewien niewysłany list, który tego dnia przepadł w płomieniach. Czy możesz go dostarczyć?"

#. Key:	SpeechBubble_SpeechBubbleData_1_SpeechBubble_Ghost_Quest_03_2_MessageTextId
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/Data/String/UI/ST_SpeechBubble.ST_SpeechBubble
#. InfoMetaData:	"DevComment" : "유령 퀘스트 03 단계 2 말풍선 대사"
#. InfoMetaData:	"IsTranslatable" : "1"
#. InfoMetaData:	"MaxLen" : "0"
#. InfoMetaData:	"MaxLines" : "0"
#: /Game/Data/String/UI/ST_SpeechBubble.ST_SpeechBubble
msgctxt "ST_SpeechBubble,SpeechBubble_SpeechBubbleData_1_SpeechBubble_Ghost_Quest_03_2_MessageTextId"
msgid "이제 됐어… 불길 속에서 멈췄던 시간이, 이 한 장으로 다시 흐르기 시작하겠지."
msgstr "Wystarczy… Czas, który stanął w płomieniach, znów zacznie biec do przodu dzięki tej kartce papieru"

#. Key:	SpeechBubble_SpeechBubbleData_1_SpeechBubble_Ghost_Quest_03_3_MessageTextId
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/Data/String/UI/ST_SpeechBubble.ST_SpeechBubble
#. InfoMetaData:	"DevComment" : "유령 퀘스트 03 완료 감사 말풍선 대사"
#. InfoMetaData:	"IsTranslatable" : "1"
#. InfoMetaData:	"MaxLen" : "0"
#. InfoMetaData:	"MaxLines" : "0"
#: /Game/Data/String/UI/ST_SpeechBubble.ST_SpeechBubble
msgctxt "ST_SpeechBubble,SpeechBubble_SpeechBubbleData_1_SpeechBubble_Ghost_Quest_03_3_MessageTextId"
msgid "이제 제 마음이 닿았네요. 정말 감사합니다… 덕분에 미처 끝내지 못한 이야기를 전할 수 있었습니다."
msgstr "Moje uczucia dotarły do adresata. Bardzo dziękuję… Wreszcie mogę dokończyć historię, której nie udało mi się opowiedzieć"

#. Key:	SpeechBubble_SpeechBubbleData_1_SpeechBubble_Ghost_Quest_03_4_MessageTextId
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/Data/String/UI/ST_SpeechBubble.ST_SpeechBubble
#. InfoMetaData:	"DevComment" : "유령 퀘스트 03 편지 전달 완료 감사 말풍선"
#. InfoMetaData:	"IsTranslatable" : "1"
#. InfoMetaData:	"MaxLen" : "0"
#. InfoMetaData:	"MaxLines" : "0"
#: /Game/Data/String/UI/ST_SpeechBubble.ST_SpeechBubble
msgctxt "ST_SpeechBubble,SpeechBubble_SpeechBubbleData_1_SpeechBubble_Ghost_Quest_03_4_MessageTextId"
msgid "그 편지는 단순한 종이가 아니었어요. 그분의 마지막 약속이었죠. 전해주셔서 감사합니다."
msgstr "Ten list to coś więcej niż kawałek papieru. To ostatnia obietnica. Dziękuję ci za jego dostarczenie"

#. Key:	SpeechBubble_SpeechBubbleData_1_SpeechBubble_Ghost_Quest_03_Start_MessageTextId
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/Data/String/UI/ST_SpeechBubble.ST_SpeechBubble
#. InfoMetaData:	"DevComment" : "유령 퀘스트 03 시작 안내 말풍선"
#. InfoMetaData:	"IsTranslatable" : "1"
#. InfoMetaData:	"MaxLen" : "0"
#. InfoMetaData:	"MaxLines" : "0"
#: /Game/Data/String/UI/ST_SpeechBubble.ST_SpeechBubble
msgctxt "ST_SpeechBubble,SpeechBubble_SpeechBubbleData_1_SpeechBubble_Ghost_Quest_03_Start_MessageTextId"
msgid "전하지 못한 편지를 품은 유령이 있다고 합니다… 그 편지에 담긴 이야기를, 들어주시겠어요?"
msgstr "Podobno jakiś duch ma przy sobie niewysłany list… Wysłuchasz opowieści o liście?"

#. Key:	SpeechBubble_SpeechBubbleData_1_SpeechBubble_Ghost_Quest_04_1_MessageTextId
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/Data/String/UI/ST_SpeechBubble.ST_SpeechBubble
#. InfoMetaData:	"DevComment" : "유령 퀘스트 04 진행 말풍선 대사"
#. InfoMetaData:	"IsTranslatable" : "1"
#. InfoMetaData:	"MaxLen" : "0"
#. InfoMetaData:	"MaxLines" : "0"
#: /Game/Data/String/UI/ST_SpeechBubble.ST_SpeechBubble
msgctxt "ST_SpeechBubble,SpeechBubble_SpeechBubbleData_1_SpeechBubble_Ghost_Quest_04_1_MessageTextId"
msgid "이 간식을 좀 건네주실 수 있을까요? 그 아이가 아직도 제 손길을 기다리고 있거든요."
msgstr "Czy możesz przekazać tę przekąskę? Mały kotek wciąż oczekuje, że się nim zaopiekuję"

#. Key:	SpeechBubble_SpeechBubbleData_1_SpeechBubble_Ghost_Quest_04_2_MessageTextId
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/Data/String/UI/ST_SpeechBubble.ST_SpeechBubble
#. InfoMetaData:	"DevComment" : "유령 퀘스트 04 고양이 간식 전달 직후 말풍선"
#. InfoMetaData:	"IsTranslatable" : "1"
#. InfoMetaData:	"MaxLen" : "0"
#. InfoMetaData:	"MaxLines" : "0"
#: /Game/Data/String/UI/ST_SpeechBubble.ST_SpeechBubble
msgctxt "ST_SpeechBubble,SpeechBubble_SpeechBubbleData_1_SpeechBubble_Ghost_Quest_04_2_MessageTextId"
msgid "잘 먹네… 할머니가 여전히 널 챙기고 있단다. 이제 외롭지 않지?"
msgstr "Dobrze, że masz apetyt… Babcia wciąż się o ciebie troszczy, wiesz? Nie czujesz się już samotnie, prawda?"

#. Key:	SpeechBubble_SpeechBubbleData_1_SpeechBubble_Ghost_Quest_04_3_MessageTextId
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/Data/String/UI/ST_SpeechBubble.ST_SpeechBubble
#. InfoMetaData:	"DevComment" : "유령 퀘스트 04 고양이 안부 확인 후 안도 말풍선"
#. InfoMetaData:	"IsTranslatable" : "1"
#. InfoMetaData:	"MaxLen" : "0"
#. InfoMetaData:	"MaxLines" : "0"
#: /Game/Data/String/UI/ST_SpeechBubble.ST_SpeechBubble
msgctxt "ST_SpeechBubble,SpeechBubble_SpeechBubbleData_1_SpeechBubble_Ghost_Quest_04_3_MessageTextId"
msgid "그 아이가 잘 지낸다니… 정말 다행이네요. 생전에 그 녀석 밥 챙기는 게 제 하루의 시작이었거든요. 이제야 마음이 놓입니다."
msgstr "Bardzo się cieszę, że kociak dobrze sobie radzi… Gdy żyłam, zawsze zaczynałam dzień od karmienia kota. Teraz wreszcie mogę spokojnie odejść"

#. Key:	SpeechBubble_SpeechBubbleData_1_SpeechBubble_Ghost_Quest_04_4_MessageTextId
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/Data/String/UI/ST_SpeechBubble.ST_SpeechBubble
#. InfoMetaData:	"DevComment" : "유령 퀘스트 04-4 완료 감사 말풍선"
#. InfoMetaData:	"IsTranslatable" : "1"
#. InfoMetaData:	"MaxLen" : "0"
#. InfoMetaData:	"MaxLines" : "0"
#: /Game/Data/String/UI/ST_SpeechBubble.ST_SpeechBubble
msgctxt "ST_SpeechBubble,SpeechBubble_SpeechBubbleData_1_SpeechBubble_Ghost_Quest_04_4_MessageTextId"
msgid "이제 그분도, 그 고양이도 외롭지 않겠네요. 부탁을 들어줘서 정말 감사합니다."
msgstr "Teraz ani ta pani, ani kot nie będą już samotni. Dziękuję za tę przysługę"

#. Key:	SpeechBubble_SpeechBubbleData_1_SpeechBubble_Ghost_Quest_04_Start_MessageTextId
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/Data/String/UI/ST_SpeechBubble.ST_SpeechBubble
#. InfoMetaData:	"DevComment" : "유령 퀘스트 04 고양이 밥 부탁 시작 말풍선"
#. InfoMetaData:	"IsTranslatable" : "1"
#. InfoMetaData:	"MaxLen" : "0"
#. InfoMetaData:	"MaxLines" : "0"
#: /Game/Data/String/UI/ST_SpeechBubble.ST_SpeechBubble
msgctxt "ST_SpeechBubble,SpeechBubble_SpeechBubbleData_1_SpeechBubble_Ghost_Quest_04_Start_MessageTextId"
msgid "생전에 매일 고양이 밥을 챙기던 할머니 유령이 있다고 합니다… 그분의 마음을, 대신 전해주시겠습니까?"
msgstr "Podobno istnieje duch jakiejś staruszki, która codziennie karmiła kota… Czy możesz przekazać w jej imieniu miłość do zwierzaka?"

#. Key:	SpeechBubble_SpeechBubbleData_1_SpeechBubble_Ghost_Quest_05_1_MessageTextId
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/Data/String/UI/ST_SpeechBubble.ST_SpeechBubble
#. InfoMetaData:	"DevComment" : "유령 퀘스트 05 진행 중 유령 말풍선"
#. InfoMetaData:	"IsTranslatable" : "1"
#. InfoMetaData:	"MaxLen" : "0"
#. InfoMetaData:	"MaxLines" : "0"
#: /Game/Data/String/UI/ST_SpeechBubble.ST_SpeechBubble
msgctxt "ST_SpeechBubble,SpeechBubble_SpeechBubbleData_1_SpeechBubble_Ghost_Quest_05_1_MessageTextId"
msgid "살아 있을 땐 마음 편히 한입도 먹지 못했어요… 이제는 냄새라도 맡고 싶네요. 묘 앞에 따뜻한 음식 하나만 놓아주실 수 있을까요?”"
msgstr "Za życia nigdy nie udało mi się nacieszyć jedzeniem… Teraz sam zapach by mnie zadowolił. Czy możesz zostawić ciepły posiłek przy grobie?"

#. Key:	SpeechBubble_SpeechBubbleData_1_SpeechBubble_Ghost_Quest_05_2_MessageTextId
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/Data/String/UI/ST_SpeechBubble.ST_SpeechBubble
#. InfoMetaData:	"DevComment" : "다이어터 유령 퀘스트 음식 공양 후 위로 말풍선"
#. InfoMetaData:	"IsTranslatable" : "1"
#. InfoMetaData:	"MaxLen" : "0"
#. InfoMetaData:	"MaxLines" : "0"
#: /Game/Data/String/UI/ST_SpeechBubble.ST_SpeechBubble
msgctxt "ST_SpeechBubble,SpeechBubble_SpeechBubbleData_1_SpeechBubble_Ghost_Quest_05_2_MessageTextId"
msgid "이젠 마음껏 먹어요… 이제 아무도 뭐라 하지 않을 거예요. 정말 수고 많으셨어요"
msgstr "Jedz, ile tylko chcesz… Nikt nie powie ci, że już dość. Należy ci się po tym, co cię spotkało"

#. Key:	SpeechBubble_SpeechBubbleData_1_SpeechBubble_Ghost_Quest_05_3_MessageTextId
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/Data/String/UI/ST_SpeechBubble.ST_SpeechBubble
#. InfoMetaData:	"DevComment" : "다이어터 유령 퀘스트 음식 냄새 공양 후 안도 감사 말풍선"
#. InfoMetaData:	"IsTranslatable" : "1"
#. InfoMetaData:	"MaxLen" : "0"
#. InfoMetaData:	"MaxLines" : "0"
#: /Game/Data/String/UI/ST_SpeechBubble.ST_SpeechBubble
msgctxt "ST_SpeechBubble,SpeechBubble_SpeechBubbleData_1_SpeechBubble_Ghost_Quest_05_3_MessageTextId"
msgid "고맙습니다… 그 냄새만으로도 배가 부르네요. 이제야 정말, 배고픔도 마음도 다 놓을 수 있을 것 같아요."
msgstr "Dziękuję… Sam zapach wystarczy. Wreszcie czuję, że mogę zapomnieć o głodzie i tęsknocie"

#. Key:	SpeechBubble_SpeechBubbleData_1_SpeechBubble_Ghost_Quest_05_4_MessageTextId
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/Data/String/UI/ST_SpeechBubble.ST_SpeechBubble
#. InfoMetaData:	"DevComment" : "다이어터 유령 퀘스트 완료 위로 말풍선"
#. InfoMetaData:	"IsTranslatable" : "1"
#. InfoMetaData:	"MaxLen" : "0"
#. InfoMetaData:	"MaxLines" : "0"
#: /Game/Data/String/UI/ST_SpeechBubble.ST_SpeechBubble
msgctxt "ST_SpeechBubble,SpeechBubble_SpeechBubbleData_1_SpeechBubble_Ghost_Quest_05_4_MessageTextId"
msgid "생전에 참 고생이 많으셨죠… 이제는 마음도, 배도 따뜻해지셨을 거예요. 정말 수고 많으셨습니다."
msgstr "Ta osoba tyle przeszła… ale teraz jej serce i żołądek nie są już puste. Świetnie ci poszło"

#. Key:	SpeechBubble_SpeechBubbleData_1_SpeechBubble_Ghost_Quest_05_Start_MessageTextId
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/Data/String/UI/ST_SpeechBubble.ST_SpeechBubble
#. InfoMetaData:	"DevComment" : "유령 퀘스트 05 시작 제안 말풍선"
#. InfoMetaData:	"IsTranslatable" : "1"
#. InfoMetaData:	"MaxLen" : "0"
#. InfoMetaData:	"MaxLines" : "0"
#: /Game/Data/String/UI/ST_SpeechBubble.ST_SpeechBubble
msgctxt "ST_SpeechBubble,SpeechBubble_SpeechBubbleData_1_SpeechBubble_Ghost_Quest_05_Start_MessageTextId"
msgid "굶주림 끝에 생을 마감한 다이어터의 유령이 있다고 합니다… 그 슬픈 사연을, 들어주시겠습니까?"
msgstr "Podobno istnieje duch osoby, która zmarła z głodu przez odchudzanie… Wysłuchasz tej opowieści?"

#. Key:	SpeechBubble_SpeechBubbleData_1_SpeechBubble_Give_Candy_MessageTextId
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/Data/String/UI/ST_SpeechBubble.ST_SpeechBubble
#. InfoMetaData:	"DevComment" : "사탕 주기 상호작용 말풍선"
#. InfoMetaData:	"IsTranslatable" : "1"
#. InfoMetaData:	"MaxLen" : "0"
#. InfoMetaData:	"MaxLines" : "0"
#: /Game/Data/String/UI/ST_SpeechBubble.ST_SpeechBubble
msgctxt "ST_SpeechBubble,SpeechBubble_SpeechBubbleData_1_SpeechBubble_Give_Candy_MessageTextId"
msgid "사탕 먹고 건강해야 돼, 알겠지?"
msgstr "Zjedz cukierka i trzymaj się, dobrze?"

#. Key:	SpeechBubble_SpeechBubbleData_1_SpeechBubble_GoalAchieve_BoughtMotorcycle_MessageTextId
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/Data/String/UI/ST_SpeechBubble.ST_SpeechBubble
#. InfoMetaData:	"DevComment" : "오토바이 구매 목표 달성 시 말풍선"
#. InfoMetaData:	"IsTranslatable" : "1"
#. InfoMetaData:	"MaxLen" : "0"
#. InfoMetaData:	"MaxLines" : "0"
#: /Game/Data/String/UI/ST_SpeechBubble.ST_SpeechBubble
msgctxt "ST_SpeechBubble,SpeechBubble_SpeechBubbleData_1_SpeechBubble_GoalAchieve_BoughtMotorcycle_MessageTextId"
msgid "와… 진짜 내 거야?"
msgstr "Łoł… Naprawdę mogę go zatrzymać?"

#. Key:	SpeechBubble_SpeechBubbleData_1_SpeechBubble_GroupContext_AdultTalking_Act1_1_T_MessageTextId
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/Data/String/UI/ST_SpeechBubble.ST_SpeechBubble
#. InfoMetaData:	"DevComment" : "성인 대화 상황 Act1 기본 말풍선"
#. InfoMetaData:	"IsTranslatable" : "1"
#. InfoMetaData:	"MaxLen" : "0"
#. InfoMetaData:	"MaxLines" : "0"
#: /Game/Data/String/UI/ST_SpeechBubble.ST_SpeechBubble
msgctxt "ST_SpeechBubble,SpeechBubble_SpeechBubbleData_1_SpeechBubble_GroupContext_AdultTalking_Act1_1_T_MessageTextId"
msgid "뭔가 복잡하고 오묘한 느낌이에요…"
msgstr "To dziwne i skomplikowane…"

#. Key:	SpeechBubble_SpeechBubbleData_1_SpeechBubble_GroupContext_AdultTalking_Act2_1_T_MessageTextId
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/Data/String/UI/ST_SpeechBubble.ST_SpeechBubble
#. InfoMetaData:	"DevComment" : "성인 대화 상황 기본 말풍선 문구"
#. InfoMetaData:	"IsTranslatable" : "1"
#. InfoMetaData:	"MaxLen" : "0"
#. InfoMetaData:	"MaxLines" : "0"
#: /Game/Data/String/UI/ST_SpeechBubble.ST_SpeechBubble
msgctxt "ST_SpeechBubble,SpeechBubble_SpeechBubbleData_1_SpeechBubble_GroupContext_AdultTalking_Act2_1_T_MessageTextId"
msgid "얼마나 사랑스러울까요?"
msgstr "Musi być urocze!"

#. Key:	SpeechBubble_SpeechBubbleData_1_SpeechBubble_GroupContext_AdultTalking_Act3_1_T_MessageTextId
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/Data/String/UI/ST_SpeechBubble.ST_SpeechBubble
#. InfoMetaData:	"DevComment" : "성인 대화 맥락 Act3 말풍선 대사"
#. InfoMetaData:	"IsTranslatable" : "1"
#. InfoMetaData:	"MaxLen" : "0"
#. InfoMetaData:	"MaxLines" : "0"
#: /Game/Data/String/UI/ST_SpeechBubble.ST_SpeechBubble
msgctxt "ST_SpeechBubble,SpeechBubble_SpeechBubbleData_1_SpeechBubble_GroupContext_AdultTalking_Act3_1_T_MessageTextId"
msgid "어머, 저도 그거 사려고 했는데!"
