msgstr "Mam informacje, które potwierdzają moją opinię."

#. Key:	SpeechBubble_SpeechBubbleData_1_Trait_Arrogant_ShowerSing_SpeechBubble_MessageTextId
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/Data/String/UI/ST_SpeechBubble.ST_SpeechBubble
#. InfoMetaData:	"DevComment" : "오만 특성 캐릭터가 샤워 중 노래할 때 표시되는 말풍선"
