msgctxt "ST_SpeechBubble,SpeechBubble_SpeechBubbleData_1_Trait_Cooperator_Runaway_MessageTextId"
msgid "이 집에서 벗어났음 해."
msgstr "Chcę opuścić ten dom."

#. Key:	SpeechBubble_SpeechBubbleData_1_Trait_Cooperator_Search_SpeechBubble_MessageTextId
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/Data/String/UI/ST_SpeechBubble.ST_SpeechBubble
#. InfoMetaData:	"DevComment" : "협조적 성향 캐릭터의 정보 공유 의도 말풍선"
#. InfoMetaData:	"IsTranslatable" : "1"
#. InfoMetaData:	"MaxLen" : "0"
#. InfoMetaData:	"MaxLines" : "0"
#: /Game/Data/String/UI/ST_SpeechBubble.ST_SpeechBubble
msgctxt "ST_SpeechBubble,SpeechBubble_SpeechBubbleData_1_Trait_Cooperator_Search_SpeechBubble_MessageTextId"
msgid "이 정보를 주변과 공유해서 도움을 줘야지."
msgstr "Muszę podzielić się tym z innymi, żeby im pomóc."

#. Key:	SpeechBubble_SpeechBubbleData_1_Trait_Cooperator_ShowerSing_SpeechBubble_MessageTextId
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/Data/String/UI/ST_SpeechBubble.ST_SpeechBubble
#. InfoMetaData:	"DevComment" : "협동 성향 캐릭터의 샤워 중 합창 희망 말풍선"
