msgctxt "ST_SpeechBubble,SpeechBubble_SpeechBubbleData_1_Trait_Cooperator_StealItem_MessageTextId"
msgid "짜릿함을 맛봐야 해."
msgstr "Chcę poczuć ekscytację."

#. Key:	SpeechBubble_SpeechBubbleData_1_Trait_Dreamer_AnalysePicture_Preference_SpeechBubble_MessageTextId
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/Data/String/UI/ST_SpeechBubble.ST_SpeechBubble
#. InfoMetaData:	"DevComment" : "드리머 특성의 그림 감상 선호 반응 말풍선 (글로서리 포함)"
#. InfoMetaData:	"IsTranslatable" : "1"
#. InfoMetaData:	"MaxLen" : "0"
#. InfoMetaData:	"MaxLines" : "0"
#: /Game/Data/String/UI/ST_SpeechBubble.ST_SpeechBubble
msgctxt "ST_SpeechBubble,SpeechBubble_SpeechBubbleData_1_Trait_Dreamer_AnalysePicture_Preference_SpeechBubble_MessageTextId"
msgid "그림 감상은 별로지만 덕분에 많은 걸 떠올렸어."
msgstr "Nie przepadam za docenianiem sztuki, ale dzięki temu myślę o wielu rzeczach."

#. Key:	SpeechBubble_SpeechBubbleData_1_Trait_Dreamer_AnalysePicture_SpeechBubble_MessageTextId
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/Data/String/UI/ST_SpeechBubble.ST_SpeechBubble
#. InfoMetaData:	"DevComment" : "몽상가 특성 캐릭터의 그림 분석 후 상상의 세계에 몰입한 반응 말풍선 문구"
#. InfoMetaData:	"IsTranslatable" : "1"
#. InfoMetaData:	"MaxLen" : "0"
#. InfoMetaData:	"MaxLines" : "0"
#: /Game/Data/String/UI/ST_SpeechBubble.ST_SpeechBubble
msgctxt "ST_SpeechBubble,SpeechBubble_SpeechBubbleData_1_Trait_Dreamer_AnalysePicture_SpeechBubble_MessageTextId"
msgid "나만의 상상의 세계에 빠졌다가 나온 것 같아."
msgstr "Czuję, jakby dopiero co udało mi się wrócić ze świata wyobraźni."

#. Key:	SpeechBubble_SpeechBubbleData_1_Trait_Dreamer_Bath_MessageTextId
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/Data/String/UI/ST_SpeechBubble.ST_SpeechBubble
#. InfoMetaData:	"DevComment" : "캐릭터 머리 위 말풍선, 몽상가 특성의 목욕 긍정 반응"
#. InfoMetaData:	"IsTranslatable" : "1"
#. InfoMetaData:	"MaxLen" : "0"
#. InfoMetaData:	"MaxLines" : "0"
#: /Game/Data/String/UI/ST_SpeechBubble.ST_SpeechBubble
msgctxt "ST_SpeechBubble,SpeechBubble_SpeechBubbleData_1_Trait_Dreamer_Bath_MessageTextId"
msgid "따뜻한 물에 몸을 담그고 나면 모든 걱정이 사라져."
msgstr "Pławienie się w gorącej wodzie przegania wszystkie zmartwienia."

#. Key:	SpeechBubble_SpeechBubbleData_1_Trait_Dreamer_Bath_Preference_Dislike_MessageTextId
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/Data/String/UI/ST_SpeechBubble.ST_SpeechBubble
#. InfoMetaData:	"DevComment" : "캐릭터 머리 위 말풍선, 몽상가 특성의 목욕 비선호 반응"
#. InfoMetaData:	"IsTranslatable" : "1"
#. InfoMetaData:	"MaxLen" : "0"
#. InfoMetaData:	"MaxLines" : "0"
#: /Game/Data/String/UI/ST_SpeechBubble.ST_SpeechBubble
msgctxt "ST_SpeechBubble,SpeechBubble_SpeechBubbleData_1_Trait_Dreamer_Bath_Preference_Dislike_MessageTextId"
msgid "목욕은 별로지만 조금 진정된 것 같아."
msgstr "Nie lubię kąpieli, ale czuję większy relaks."

#. Key:	SpeechBubble_SpeechBubbleData_1_Trait_Dreamer_Emotion_Bad_MessageTextId
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/Data/String/UI/ST_SpeechBubble.ST_SpeechBubble
#. InfoMetaData:	"DevComment" : "몽상가 특성 부정 감정 상태 더 나은 자신이 되고 싶지만 실천이 어려운 답답함 말풍선 문구"
#. InfoMetaData:	"IsTranslatable" : "1"
#. InfoMetaData:	"MaxLen" : "0"
#. InfoMetaData:	"MaxLines" : "0"
#: /Game/Data/String/UI/ST_SpeechBubble.ST_SpeechBubble
msgctxt "ST_SpeechBubble,SpeechBubble_SpeechBubbleData_1_Trait_Dreamer_Emotion_Bad_MessageTextId"
msgid "더 나은 내가 되고 싶지만 실천하기 어려워."
msgstr "Chcę zostać lepszą wersją siebie, ale trudno to wprowadzić w życie."

#. Key:	SpeechBubble_SpeechBubbleData_1_Trait_Dreamer_Emotion_Good_MessageTextId
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/Data/String/UI/ST_SpeechBubble.ST_SpeechBubble
#. InfoMetaData:	"DevComment" : "몽상가 특성 긍정 감정 상태 평화롭고 조화로운 하루를 바라는 말풍선 문구"
#. InfoMetaData:	"IsTranslatable" : "1"
#. InfoMetaData:	"MaxLen" : "0"
#. InfoMetaData:	"MaxLines" : "0"
#: /Game/Data/String/UI/ST_SpeechBubble.ST_SpeechBubble
msgctxt "ST_SpeechBubble,SpeechBubble_SpeechBubbleData_1_Trait_Dreamer_Emotion_Good_MessageTextId"
msgid "평화롭고 조화로운 하루가 계속되길 바라."
msgstr "Mam nadzieję na więcej spokojnych i harmonijnych dni."

#. Key:	SpeechBubble_SpeechBubbleData_1_Trait_Dreamer_EndLove_MessageTextId
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/Data/String/UI/ST_SpeechBubble.ST_SpeechBubble
#. InfoMetaData:	"DevComment" : "몽상가 특성 연애 종료 시 말풍선 문구"
#. InfoMetaData:	"IsTranslatable" : "1"
#. InfoMetaData:	"MaxLen" : "0"
#. InfoMetaData:	"MaxLines" : "0"
#: /Game/Data/String/UI/ST_SpeechBubble.ST_SpeechBubble
msgctxt "ST_SpeechBubble,SpeechBubble_SpeechBubbleData_1_Trait_Dreamer_EndLove_MessageTextId"
msgid "내가 꿈꾸던 사랑이 아니야."
msgstr "To nie jest wymarzona miłość."

#. Key:	SpeechBubble_SpeechBubbleData_1_Trait_Dreamer_Memoir_SpeechBubble_MessageTextId
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/Data/String/UI/ST_SpeechBubble.ST_SpeechBubble
#. InfoMetaData:	"DevComment" : "몽상가 특성 회고 말풍선 문구"
#. InfoMetaData:	"IsTranslatable" : "1"
#. InfoMetaData:	"MaxLen" : "0"
#. InfoMetaData:	"MaxLines" : "0"
#: /Game/Data/String/UI/ST_SpeechBubble.ST_SpeechBubble
msgctxt "ST_SpeechBubble,SpeechBubble_SpeechBubbleData_1_Trait_Dreamer_Memoir_SpeechBubble_MessageTextId"
msgid "내면의 감정을 정리하는 데 도움이 되었어."
msgstr "Pomogło mi to okiełznać emocje."

#. Key:	SpeechBubble_SpeechBubbleData_1_Trait_Dreamer_Novel_MessageTextId
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/Data/String/UI/ST_SpeechBubble.ST_SpeechBubble
#. InfoMetaData:	"DevComment" : "몽상가 특성 캐릭터의 소설책 독서 후 삶의 철학 성찰 반응 머리 위 말풍선 문구"
#. InfoMetaData:	"IsTranslatable" : "1"
#. InfoMetaData:	"MaxLen" : "0"
#. InfoMetaData:	"MaxLines" : "0"
#: /Game/Data/String/UI/ST_SpeechBubble.ST_SpeechBubble
msgctxt "ST_SpeechBubble,SpeechBubble_SpeechBubbleData_1_Trait_Dreamer_Novel_MessageTextId"
msgid "책 속에서 삶의 철학을 배울 수 있어."
msgstr "Mogę nauczyć się życiowej filozofii z książek."

#. Key:	SpeechBubble_SpeechBubbleData_1_Trait_Dreamer_Novel_Preference_Dislike_MessageTextId
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/Data/String/UI/ST_SpeechBubble.ST_SpeechBubble
#. InfoMetaData:	"DevComment" : "몽상가 특성 캐릭터의 비선호 소설책 독서 후 삶의 철학 성찰 반응 머리 위 말풍선 문구"
#. InfoMetaData:	"IsTranslatable" : "1"
#. InfoMetaData:	"MaxLen" : "0"
#. InfoMetaData:	"MaxLines" : "0"
#: /Game/Data/String/UI/ST_SpeechBubble.ST_SpeechBubble
msgctxt "ST_SpeechBubble,SpeechBubble_SpeechBubbleData_1_Trait_Dreamer_Novel_Preference_Dislike_MessageTextId"
msgid "소설책은 별로지만 삶의 철학을 배우는 길이야."
msgstr "Nie lubię powieści, ale można się z nich nauczyć filozofii życia."

#. Key:	SpeechBubble_SpeechBubbleData_1_Trait_Dreamer_PlantSmell_MessageTextId
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/Data/String/UI/ST_SpeechBubble.ST_SpeechBubble
#. InfoMetaData:	"DevComment" : "캐릭터 머리 위 말풍선, 몽상가 특성의 식물 향기 맡기 긍정 반응"
#. InfoMetaData:	"IsTranslatable" : "1"
#. InfoMetaData:	"MaxLen" : "0"
#. InfoMetaData:	"MaxLines" : "0"
#: /Game/Data/String/UI/ST_SpeechBubble.ST_SpeechBubble
msgctxt "ST_SpeechBubble,SpeechBubble_SpeechBubbleData_1_Trait_Dreamer_PlantSmell_MessageTextId"
msgid "사람들도 식물처럼 무해하면 좋을 텐데."
msgstr "Byłoby fajnie, gdyby ludzie byli równie niegroźni co rośliny."

#. Key:	SpeechBubble_SpeechBubbleData_1_Trait_Dreamer_PlantSmell_Preference_Dislike_MessageTextId
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/Data/String/UI/ST_SpeechBubble.ST_SpeechBubble
#. InfoMetaData:	"DevComment" : "캐릭터 머리 위 말풍선, 몽상가 특성의 식물 냄새 비선호 반응"
#. InfoMetaData:	"IsTranslatable" : "1"
#. InfoMetaData:	"MaxLen" : "0"
#. InfoMetaData:	"MaxLines" : "0"
#: /Game/Data/String/UI/ST_SpeechBubble.ST_SpeechBubble
msgctxt "ST_SpeechBubble,SpeechBubble_SpeechBubbleData_1_Trait_Dreamer_PlantSmell_Preference_Dislike_MessageTextId"
msgid "식물은 별로지만 마음은 진정된 것 같아."
msgstr "Nie lubię roślin, ale wygląda na to, że uspokajają mój umysł."

#. Key:	SpeechBubble_SpeechBubbleData_1_Trait_Dreamer_Stretching_SpeechBubble_MessageTextId
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/Data/String/UI/ST_SpeechBubble.ST_SpeechBubble
#. InfoMetaData:	"DevComment" : "몽상가 특성 조이가 스트레칭 중 말하는 말풍선 문구"
#. InfoMetaData:	"IsTranslatable" : "1"
#. InfoMetaData:	"MaxLen" : "0"
#. InfoMetaData:	"MaxLines" : "0"
#: /Game/Data/String/UI/ST_SpeechBubble.ST_SpeechBubble
msgctxt "ST_SpeechBubble,SpeechBubble_SpeechBubbleData_1_Trait_Dreamer_Stretching_SpeechBubble_MessageTextId"
msgid "평화롭고 나른한 기분이야."
msgstr "Czuję spokój i senność."

#. Key:	SpeechBubble_SpeechBubbleData_1_Trait_Dreamer_Sun_MessageTextId
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/Data/String/UI/ST_SpeechBubble.ST_SpeechBubble
#. InfoMetaData:	"DevComment" : "몽상가 성향 캐릭터의 맑은 날씨 반응 머리 위 말풍선"
#. InfoMetaData:	"IsTranslatable" : "1"
#. InfoMetaData:	"MaxLen" : "0"
#. InfoMetaData:	"MaxLines" : "0"
#: /Game/Data/String/UI/ST_SpeechBubble.ST_SpeechBubble
msgctxt "ST_SpeechBubble,SpeechBubble_SpeechBubbleData_1_Trait_Dreamer_Sun_MessageTextId"
msgid "빛나는 태양이 세상을 아름답게 밝혀줄 거야."
msgstr "Promienie słońca sprawiają, że wszystko jest piękniejsze."

#. Key:	SpeechBubble_SpeechBubbleData_1_Trait_Dreamer_TalkFate_MessageTextId
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/Data/String/UI/ST_SpeechBubble.ST_SpeechBubble
#. InfoMetaData:	"DevComment" : "몽상가 특성의 운명 대화 시 희망 말풍선 문구"
#. InfoMetaData:	"IsTranslatable" : "1"
#. InfoMetaData:	"MaxLen" : "0"
#. InfoMetaData:	"MaxLines" : "0"
#: /Game/Data/String/UI/ST_SpeechBubble.ST_SpeechBubble
msgctxt "ST_SpeechBubble,SpeechBubble_SpeechBubbleData_1_Trait_Dreamer_TalkFate_MessageTextId"
msgid "운명을 함께 믿으면 좋겠어."
msgstr "Chcę wierzyć we wspólny los."

#. Key:	SpeechBubble_SpeechBubbleData_1_Trait_Dreamer_TalkPhilosophy_MessageTextId
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/Data/String/UI/ST_SpeechBubble.ST_SpeechBubble
#. InfoMetaData:	"DevComment" : "몽상가 특성 철학 대화 시 희망 말풍선 문구"
#. InfoMetaData:	"IsTranslatable" : "1"
#. InfoMetaData:	"MaxLen" : "0"
#. InfoMetaData:	"MaxLines" : "0"
#: /Game/Data/String/UI/ST_SpeechBubble.ST_SpeechBubble
msgctxt "ST_SpeechBubble,SpeechBubble_SpeechBubbleData_1_Trait_Dreamer_TalkPhilosophy_MessageTextId"
msgid "생각을 나누면 좋겠어."
msgstr "Chcę podzielić się przemyśleniami."

#. Key:	SpeechBubble_SpeechBubbleData_1_Trait_Dreamer_TalkSoul_MessageTextId
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/Data/String/UI/ST_SpeechBubble.ST_SpeechBubble
#. InfoMetaData:	"DevComment" : "몽상가 특성 영혼 대화 시 희망 말풍선"
#. InfoMetaData:	"IsTranslatable" : "1"
#. InfoMetaData:	"MaxLen" : "0"
#. InfoMetaData:	"MaxLines" : "0"
#: /Game/Data/String/UI/ST_SpeechBubble.ST_SpeechBubble
msgctxt "ST_SpeechBubble,SpeechBubble_SpeechBubbleData_1_Trait_Dreamer_TalkSoul_MessageTextId"
msgid "심오한 이야기를 나누면 좋겠어."
msgstr "Chcę podzielić się wzruszającymi historiami."

#. Key:	SpeechBubble_SpeechBubbleData_1_Trait_Dreamer_TrafficAccident_MessageTextId
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/Data/String/UI/ST_SpeechBubble.ST_SpeechBubble
