msgid "혼자만의 시간을 즐겨야 해."
msgstr "Chcę spędzić czas w samotności."

#. Key:	SpeechBubble_SpeechBubbleData_1_Trait_Lazy_AskOtherCook_MessageTextId
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/Data/String/UI/ST_SpeechBubble.ST_SpeechBubble
#. InfoMetaData:	"DevComment" : "게으름 특성의 타인 요리 희망 말풍선"
