msgctxt "ST_SpeechBubble,SpeechBubble_SpeechBubbleData_1_Trait_Lazy_AskOtherCook_MessageTextId"
msgid "움직이기 귀찮으니 다른 사람이 요리해 줬으면 해."
msgstr "Nie chcę nic robić i wolę, żeby ktoś ugotował coś dla mnie."

#. Key:	SpeechBubble_SpeechBubbleData_1_Trait_Lazy_CallCleaner_MessageTextId
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/Data/String/UI/ST_SpeechBubble.ST_SpeechBubble
#. InfoMetaData:	"DevComment" : "게으름 특성 청소 대행 호출 말풍선"
