#. Key:	SpeechBubble_SpeechBubbleData_3_SpeechBubble_AR_Librarian_01_MessageTextId
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/Data/String/UI/ST_SpeechBubble.ST_SpeechBubble
#. InfoMetaData:	"IsTranslatable" : "1"
#. InfoMetaData:	"MaxLen" : "0"
#. InfoMetaData:	"MaxLines" : "0"
#: /Game/Data/String/UI/ST_SpeechBubble.ST_SpeechBubble
msgctxt "ST_SpeechBubble,SpeechBubble_SpeechBubbleData_3_SpeechBubble_AR_Librarian_01_MessageTextId"
msgid "생각이 너무 많아질 때는 조용한 숨결의 기술도 괜찮아요. 읽다 보면 마음이 차분해지거든요."
msgstr "Gdy twoje myśli stają się zbyt przytłaczające, technika cichego oddychania może okazać się niezwykle korzystna. Praktykując ją, zauważysz, że twój umysł staje się Spokojny."

#. Key:	SpeechBubble_SpeechBubbleData_3_SpeechBubble_AR_Librarian_03_MessageTextId
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/Data/String/UI/ST_SpeechBubble.ST_SpeechBubble
#. InfoMetaData:	"IsTranslatable" : "1"
#. InfoMetaData:	"MaxLen" : "0"
#. InfoMetaData:	"MaxLines" : "0"
#: /Game/Data/String/UI/ST_SpeechBubble.ST_SpeechBubble
msgctxt "ST_SpeechBubble,SpeechBubble_SpeechBubbleData_3_SpeechBubble_AR_Librarian_03_MessageTextId"
msgid "어떤 분들은 이 도서관이 오래됐다고 말하고, 어떤 분들은 이제 막 생겼다고 말하죠. 둘 다 틀리지 않았어요."
msgstr "Niektórzy mówią, że ta biblioteka istnieje już od dawna, inni zaś twierdzą, że została dopiero co założona. Oba te stwierdzenia nie są błędne."

#. Key:	SpeechBubble_SpeechBubbleData_3_SpeechBubble_AR_Librarian_04_MessageTextId
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/Data/String/UI/ST_SpeechBubble.ST_SpeechBubble
#. InfoMetaData:	"IsTranslatable" : "1"
#. InfoMetaData:	"MaxLen" : "0"
#. InfoMetaData:	"MaxLines" : "0"
#: /Game/Data/String/UI/ST_SpeechBubble.ST_SpeechBubble
msgctxt "ST_SpeechBubble,SpeechBubble_SpeechBubbleData_3_SpeechBubble_AR_Librarian_04_MessageTextId"
msgid "저 앞에서 들어오는 빛은, 멀리 다른 곳과 이어져 있어요. 어디냐고요? 그건 비밀로 해두죠"
msgstr "Światło, które dobiega z przodu, jest połączone z obcym miejscem. Gdzie, pytasz? To tajemnica, którą zachowuję dla siebie."

#. Key:	SpeechBubble_SpeechBubbleData_3_SpeechBubble_AR_Librarian_05_MessageTextId
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/Data/String/UI/ST_SpeechBubble.ST_SpeechBubble
#. InfoMetaData:	"IsTranslatable" : "1"
#. InfoMetaData:	"MaxLen" : "0"
#. InfoMetaData:	"MaxLines" : "0"
#: /Game/Data/String/UI/ST_SpeechBubble.ST_SpeechBubble
msgctxt "ST_SpeechBubble,SpeechBubble_SpeechBubbleData_3_SpeechBubble_AR_Librarian_05_MessageTextId"
msgid "2층은 아주 중요한 기록을 보관하고 있어서, 평범한 사람들은 올라가지 못해요."
msgstr "Na drugim piętrze przechowywane są dokumenty o dużym znaczeniu, dlatego dostęp dla ogółu społeczeństwa jest niezgodny z regulaminem."

#. Key:	SpeechBubble_SpeechBubbleData_3_SpeechBubble_AR_Librarian_06_MessageTextId
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/Data/String/UI/ST_SpeechBubble.ST_SpeechBubble
#. InfoMetaData:	"IsTranslatable" : "1"
#. InfoMetaData:	"MaxLen" : "0"
#. InfoMetaData:	"MaxLines" : "0"
#: /Game/Data/String/UI/ST_SpeechBubble.ST_SpeechBubble
msgctxt "ST_SpeechBubble,SpeechBubble_SpeechBubbleData_3_SpeechBubble_AR_Librarian_06_MessageTextId"
msgid "삶은 완성된 문장이 아니라, 밑줄을 그어두고 나중에 다시 읽게 되는 문장에 더 가까운 것 같아요. 시간이 지나면 삶의 의미를 깨달을 수 있을지도요?"
msgstr "Życie to nie skończone zdanie, ale raczej takie, które podkreślasz, aby do niego wrócić później. Może z czasem zdołasz zrozumieć jego znaczenie?"

