msgid "오늘은 꼭 자기 전에 허브티를 먹을 거예요."
msgstr "Na pewno przed snem wypiję dziś wieczorem herbatę ziołową."

#. Key:	SpeechBubble_SpeechBubbleData_5_SpeechBubble_Co_Henri_Preference_MessageTextId
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/Data/String/UI/ST_SpeechBubble.ST_SpeechBubble
