msgctxt "ST_SpeechBubble,SpeechBubble_SpeechBubbleData_5_SpeechBubble_Co_Henri_Preference_MessageTextId"
msgid "저는 체스 하는 걸 좋아해요."
msgstr "Cieszę się, kiedy gram w szachy."

#. Key:	SpeechBubble_SpeechBubbleData_5_SpeechBubble_Co_Muse_Inspiration_MessageTextId
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/Data/String/UI/ST_SpeechBubble.ST_SpeechBubble
#. InfoMetaData:	"DevComment" : "UniqueEventNpc 대화 스피치버블"
#. InfoMetaData:	"IsTranslatable" : "1"
#. InfoMetaData:	"MaxLen" : "0"
#. InfoMetaData:	"MaxLines" : "0"
#: /Game/Data/String/UI/ST_SpeechBubble.ST_SpeechBubble
msgctxt "ST_SpeechBubble,SpeechBubble_SpeechBubbleData_5_SpeechBubble_Co_Muse_Inspiration_MessageTextId"
msgid "캔버스의 랭킹 작품들을 확인해 보는 건 어때요? 사람들이 어떤 걸 선호하는지 느껴볼 수 있어요."
msgstr "Może warto przyjrzeć się rankingowi dzieł sztuki na Canvas, aby zrozumieć, co ludzie zazwyczaj preferują?"

#. Key:	SpeechBubble_SpeechBubbleData_5_SpeechBubble_PickFortune_Result_MessageTextId
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/Data/String/UI/ST_SpeechBubble.ST_SpeechBubble
#. InfoMetaData:	"DevComment" : "운세 결과 말풍선 문구"
#. InfoMetaData:	"IsTranslatable" : "1"
#. InfoMetaData:	"MaxLen" : "0"
#. InfoMetaData:	"MaxLines" : "0"
#: /Game/Data/String/UI/ST_SpeechBubble.ST_SpeechBubble
msgctxt "ST_SpeechBubble,SpeechBubble_SpeechBubbleData_5_SpeechBubble_PickFortune_Result_MessageTextId"
msgid "“뜻밖의 행운이… 옆 사람에게 찾아옵니다. 부러워 말고 같이 웃으세요.”"
msgstr "„Niespodziewane szczęście… podąża w kierunku osoby obok. Pohamuj zazdrość i uśmiechnij się do niej”"

#. Key:	SpeechBubble_SpeechBubbleData_5_SpeechBubble_Prison_NPC_01_1_MessageTextId
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/Data/String/UI/ST_SpeechBubble.ST_SpeechBubble
#. InfoMetaData:	"DevComment" : "교도소 NPC 01 기본 말풍선 대사"
#. InfoMetaData:	"IsTranslatable" : "1"
#. InfoMetaData:	"MaxLen" : "0"
#. InfoMetaData:	"MaxLines" : "0"
#: /Game/Data/String/UI/ST_SpeechBubble.ST_SpeechBubble
msgctxt "ST_SpeechBubble,SpeechBubble_SpeechBubbleData_5_SpeechBubble_Prison_NPC_01_1_MessageTextId"
msgid "내 죄? 단순해. 굶주렸고, 불행히도 눈앞에 있던 건 남의 것이었지."
msgstr "Moje przestępstwo? Proste, chciało mi się jeść, a nic do zjedzenia nie należało do mnie"

#. Key:	SpeechBubble_SpeechBubbleData_5_SpeechBubble_Prison_NPC_01_2_MessageTextId
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/Data/String/UI/ST_SpeechBubble.ST_SpeechBubble
#. InfoMetaData:	"DevComment" : "교도소 NPC 절망 반응 말풍선"
#. InfoMetaData:	"IsTranslatable" : "1"
#. InfoMetaData:	"MaxLen" : "0"
#. InfoMetaData:	"MaxLines" : "0"
#: /Game/Data/String/UI/ST_SpeechBubble.ST_SpeechBubble
msgctxt "ST_SpeechBubble,SpeechBubble_SpeechBubbleData_5_SpeechBubble_Prison_NPC_01_2_MessageTextId"
msgid "난 죄를 저질렀고, 죽음만이 나를 해방시킬 거야."
msgstr "Popełnione przestępstwo sprawia, że uwolni mnie tylko śmierć"

#. Key:	SpeechBubble_SpeechBubbleData_5_SpeechBubble_SmallLocalShop_Idle_MessageTextId
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/Data/String/UI/ST_SpeechBubble.ST_SpeechBubble
#. InfoMetaData:	"DevComment" : "소규모 상점 유휴 상태의 구매 유도 말풍선"
#. InfoMetaData:	"IsTranslatable" : "1"
#. InfoMetaData:	"MaxLen" : "0"
#. InfoMetaData:	"MaxLines" : "0"
#: /Game/Data/String/UI/ST_SpeechBubble.ST_SpeechBubble
msgctxt "ST_SpeechBubble,SpeechBubble_SpeechBubbleData_5_SpeechBubble_SmallLocalShop_Idle_MessageTextId"
msgid "눈은 달렸지? 보이면 하나쯤 집어서 사."
msgstr "Użyj oczu i znajdź coś do kupienia."

#. Key:	SpeechBubble_SpeechBubbleData_5_SpeechBubble_SmallLocalShop_ShopInfo_MessageTextId
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/Data/String/UI/ST_SpeechBubble.ST_SpeechBubble
#. InfoMetaData:	"DevComment" : "소규모 동네 상점 정보 말풍선"
#. InfoMetaData:	"IsTranslatable" : "1"
#. InfoMetaData:	"MaxLen" : "0"
#. InfoMetaData:	"MaxLines" : "0"
#: /Game/Data/String/UI/ST_SpeechBubble.ST_SpeechBubble
msgctxt "ST_SpeechBubble,SpeechBubble_SpeechBubbleData_5_SpeechBubble_SmallLocalShop_ShopInfo_MessageTextId"
msgid "단골이면 알지? 납품가는 내가 넉넉히 챙겨준다구~"
msgstr "Regularnie tu przychodzisz, prawda? Wiesz, że zawsze daję coś ekstra"

#. Key:	SpeechBubble_SpeechBubbleData_5_SpeechBubble_Standard_Baby_MessageTextId
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/Data/String/UI/ST_SpeechBubble.ST_SpeechBubble
#. InfoMetaData:	"IsTranslatable" : "1"
#. InfoMetaData:	"MaxLen" : "0"
