msgctxt "ST_SpeechBubble,SpeechBubble_SpeechBubbleData_5_SpeechBubble_Standard_Baby_MessageTextId"
msgid "졸려요~?"
msgstr "Chcesz spać?"

#. Key:	SpeechBubble_SpeechBubbleData_5_SpeechBubble_TackleShopWorker_01_MessageTextId
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/Data/String/UI/ST_SpeechBubble.ST_SpeechBubble
#. InfoMetaData:	"DevComment" : "태클숍 직원의 미끼 사용 팁 말풍선"
#. InfoMetaData:	"IsTranslatable" : "1"
#. InfoMetaData:	"MaxLen" : "0"
#. InfoMetaData:	"MaxLines" : "0"
#: /Game/Data/String/UI/ST_SpeechBubble.ST_SpeechBubble
msgctxt "ST_SpeechBubble,SpeechBubble_SpeechBubbleData_5_SpeechBubble_TackleShopWorker_01_MessageTextId"
msgid "미끼를 쓰면 낚시에 성공할 확률이 더 높아."
msgstr "Użycie przynęty zwiększa szansę na udany połów"

#. Key:	SpeechBubble_SpeechBubbleData_6_SpeechBubble_Co_Henri_Preference_MessageTextId
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/Data/String/UI/ST_SpeechBubble.ST_SpeechBubble
#. InfoMetaData:	"DevComment" : "UniqueEventNpc 대화 스피치버블"
#. InfoMetaData:	"IsTranslatable" : "1"
#. InfoMetaData:	"MaxLen" : "0"
#. InfoMetaData:	"MaxLines" : "0"
#: /Game/Data/String/UI/ST_SpeechBubble.ST_SpeechBubble
msgctxt "ST_SpeechBubble,SpeechBubble_SpeechBubbleData_6_SpeechBubble_Co_Henri_Preference_MessageTextId"
msgid "저는 과일을 좋아해요. 그 중에서도 포도요!"
msgstr "Uwielbiam owoce, szczególnie winogrona!"

#. Key:	SpeechBubble_SpeechBubbleData_6_SpeechBubble_PickFortune_Result_MessageTextId
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/Data/String/UI/ST_SpeechBubble.ST_SpeechBubble
#. InfoMetaData:	"DevComment" : "운세 보기 결과 말풍선 문구"
#. InfoMetaData:	"IsTranslatable" : "1"
#. InfoMetaData:	"MaxLen" : "0"
#. InfoMetaData:	"MaxLines" : "0"
#: /Game/Data/String/UI/ST_SpeechBubble.ST_SpeechBubble
msgctxt "ST_SpeechBubble,SpeechBubble_SpeechBubbleData_6_SpeechBubble_PickFortune_Result_MessageTextId"
msgid "“말 한마디가 인생을 바꿉니다. 오늘은 특히 ‘죄송합니다’가 강력합니다.”"
msgstr "„Jedno słowo może zmienić twoje życie. Przeprosiny byłyby dziś wyjątkowo potężne”"

#. Key:	SpeechBubble_SpeechBubbleData_6_SpeechBubble_SmallLocalShop_Idle_MessageTextId
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/Data/String/UI/ST_SpeechBubble.ST_SpeechBubble
#. InfoMetaData:	"DevComment" : "소규모 로컬 상점 NPC 유휴 상태 말풍선 대사"
#. InfoMetaData:	"IsTranslatable" : "1"
#. InfoMetaData:	"MaxLen" : "0"
#. InfoMetaData:	"MaxLines" : "0"
#: /Game/Data/String/UI/ST_SpeechBubble.ST_SpeechBubble
msgctxt "ST_SpeechBubble,SpeechBubble_SpeechBubbleData_6_SpeechBubble_SmallLocalShop_Idle_MessageTextId"
msgid "팔 거 있음, 말만 해. 아니 말만 하라고"
msgstr "Powiedz, jeśli masz coś na sprzedaż."

#. Key:	SpeechBubble_SpeechBubbleData_6_SpeechBubble_TackleShopWorker_01_MessageTextId
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/Data/String/UI/ST_SpeechBubble.ST_SpeechBubble
#. InfoMetaData:	"DevComment" : "낚시용품점 직원 일반 대사 말풍선"
#. InfoMetaData:	"IsTranslatable" : "1"
#. InfoMetaData:	"MaxLen" : "0"
#. InfoMetaData:	"MaxLines" : "0"
#: /Game/Data/String/UI/ST_SpeechBubble.ST_SpeechBubble
msgctxt "ST_SpeechBubble,SpeechBubble_SpeechBubbleData_6_SpeechBubble_TackleShopWorker_01_MessageTextId"
msgid "보호 어종을 방생하면 환경단체에서 기념 트로피를 준다더군."
msgstr "Podobno organizacja ds. ochrony środowiska wysyła trofeum po wypuszczeniu chronionych gatunków"

#. Key:	SpeechBubble_SpeechBubbleData_7_SpeechBubble_PickFortune_Result_MessageTextId
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/Data/String/UI/ST_SpeechBubble.ST_SpeechBubble
#. InfoMetaData:	"DevComment" : "점 보기 결과 말풍선 문구"
#. InfoMetaData:	"IsTranslatable" : "1"
#. InfoMetaData:	"MaxLen" : "0"
#. InfoMetaData:	"MaxLines" : "0"
#: /Game/Data/String/UI/ST_SpeechBubble.ST_SpeechBubble
msgctxt "ST_SpeechBubble,SpeechBubble_SpeechBubbleData_7_SpeechBubble_PickFortune_Result_MessageTextId"
msgid "“지갑을 잃어도 웃을 수 있다면, 당신은 이미 인생의 고수.”"
msgstr "„Jeśli jesteś w stanie uśmiechnąć się po zgubieniu portfela, wiesz, jak żyć”"

#. Key:	SpeechBubble_SpeechBubbleData_7_SpeechBubble_TackleShopWorker_01_MessageTextId
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/Data/String/UI/ST_SpeechBubble.ST_SpeechBubble
#. InfoMetaData:	"DevComment" : "태클숍 직원의 도감 정보 문의 유도 말풍선"
#. InfoMetaData:	"IsTranslatable" : "1"
#. InfoMetaData:	"MaxLen" : "0"
#. InfoMetaData:	"MaxLines" : "0"
#: /Game/Data/String/UI/ST_SpeechBubble.ST_SpeechBubble
msgctxt "ST_SpeechBubble,SpeechBubble_SpeechBubbleData_7_SpeechBubble_TackleShopWorker_01_MessageTextId"
msgid "도감을 채우고 싶다면 ‘도감 정보 물어보기’ 대화를 시도해 봐."
msgstr "Jeśli chcesz dokończyć dziennik kolekcji, wypróbuj interakcję „Zapytaj o dziennik kolekcji” podczas rozmowy"

#. Key:	SpeechBubble_SpeechBubbleData_8_SpeechBubble_PickFortune_Result_MessageTextId
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/Data/String/UI/ST_SpeechBubble.ST_SpeechBubble
#. InfoMetaData:	"DevComment" : "점괘 뽑기 결과 말풍선 문구"
#. InfoMetaData:	"IsTranslatable" : "1"
#. InfoMetaData:	"MaxLen" : "0"
#. InfoMetaData:	"MaxLines" : "0"
#: /Game/Data/String/UI/ST_SpeechBubble.ST_SpeechBubble
msgctxt "ST_SpeechBubble,SpeechBubble_SpeechBubbleData_8_SpeechBubble_PickFortune_Result_MessageTextId"
msgid "“기다림의 끝엔 반드시 무언가가 옵니다. 다만, 택배일 수도 있습니다.”"
msgstr "„Po oczekiwaniu zawsze coś się dzieje… choć może to być tylko zwykła dostawa”"

#. Key:	SpeechBubble_SpeechBubbleData_9_SpeechBubble_PickFortune_Result_MessageTextId
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/Data/String/UI/ST_SpeechBubble.ST_SpeechBubble
#. InfoMetaData:	"DevComment" : "운세 뽑기 결과 말풍선 문구"
#. InfoMetaData:	"IsTranslatable" : "1"
#. InfoMetaData:	"MaxLen" : "0"
#. InfoMetaData:	"MaxLines" : "0"
#: /Game/Data/String/UI/ST_SpeechBubble.ST_SpeechBubble
msgctxt "ST_SpeechBubble,SpeechBubble_SpeechBubbleData_9_SpeechBubble_PickFortune_Result_MessageTextId"
msgid "“웃음은 복권보다 낫습니다. 적어도 꽝은 없으니까요.”"
msgstr "„Śmiech jest lepszy niż kupon na loterię. Nigdy nie oznacza przegranej”"

#. Key:	UI_AfterSchoolMission_Reward_Tooltip_Text
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/Data/String/UI/ST_UI.ST_UI
#. InfoMetaData:	"DevComment" : "방과 후 활동 목표 달성 시 학업 성취도 변동 안내 툴팁 (글로서리 포함)"
#. InfoMetaData:	"IsTranslatable" : "1"
#. InfoMetaData:	"MaxLen" : "0"
#. InfoMetaData:	"MaxLines" : "0"
#: /Game/Data/String/UI/ST_UI.ST_UI
msgctxt "ST_UI,UI_AfterSchoolMission_Reward_Tooltip_Text"
msgid "목표 달성 시 학업 성취도 평가 상승, \r\n미달성 시 학업 성취도 하락\r\n성취도는 스마트폰의 '학교' 앱에서 확인 가능합니다."
msgstr "Wyniki akademickie rosną wraz z realizacją celu\r\ni pogarszają, jeśli cele nie są realizowane.\r\nMożesz sprawdzić je w aplikacji Szkoła na smartfonie."

#. Key:	UI_Aging_NonPlayFamily_Text
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/Data/String/UI/ST_UI.ST_UI
#. InfoMetaData:	"DevComment" : "옵션 - 시뮬레이션의 비플레이 가족 연령 변화 설정 안내 문구 (글로서리 포함)"
#. InfoMetaData:	"IsTranslatable" : "1"
#. InfoMetaData:	"MaxLen" : "0"
#. InfoMetaData:	"MaxLines" : "0"
#: /Game/Data/String/UI/ST_UI.ST_UI
msgctxt "ST_UI,UI_Aging_NonPlayFamily_Text"
msgid "비플레이 가족의 연령 변화는 옵션 - 시뮬레이션에서 변경할 수 있습니다."
msgstr "Ustawienia starzenia dla innych Zoi można zmienić w sekcji Symulacja w menu Opcje."

#. Key:	UI_Aging_PlayFamily_Text
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/Data/String/UI/ST_UI.ST_UI
#. InfoMetaData:	"DevComment" : "플레이 중 가족 나이 변화 체크박스 비활성화 안내 툴팁"
#. InfoMetaData:	"IsTranslatable" : "1"
#. InfoMetaData:	"MaxLen" : "0"
#. InfoMetaData:	"MaxLines" : "0"
#: /Game/Data/String/UI/ST_UI.ST_UI
msgctxt "ST_UI,UI_Aging_PlayFamily_Text"
msgid "플레이 중인 가족의 연령 변화는 옵션 - 시뮬레이션에서 변경할 수 있습니다."
msgstr "Ustawienia starzenia dla twoich Zoi można zmienić w sekcji Symulacja w menu Opcje."

